== Trivia ==
* Teratoma was added in the ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* It is the posthumous form of {{e|Fistula}}.
* A [[wikipedia:teratoma|teratoma]] is a rare tumor that contains tissues that are atypical for its placement in the body. This can include hair, teeth, bones, and so on.
* Unlike the original ''Binding Of Isaac'', Teratoma doesn't bounce off of [[Rock]]s.
* {{dlc|nr}} Teratoma is one of the three bosses that can be spawned by {{e|It Lives!}}, the other two being {{e|Chub}} and {{e|Polycephalus}}.
** {{dlc|r}} It Lives! can now spawn Fistula as well.

